## Source

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| **Title** | In-Depth Floor Plan Tutorial Part 1 [UPDATED 2025] |
| **Creator** | Blender Made Easy |
| **Platform** | YouTube |
| **URL** | https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=94kAIpRnhcY |
| **Duration** | 23:02 (1382 seconds) |
| **Chapters** | 29 official YouTube chapters |

## File Information

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| **Filename** | `tutorial_video.mp4` |
| **Format** | MP4 (H.264) |
| **Resolution** | 1920x1080 |
| **Language** | English |

## License and Usage

This video is used under **Fair Use** for research and educational purposes:

1. **Purpose**: Non-commercial academic research benchmark for AI agent evaluation
2. **Nature**: Educational tutorial content
3. **Amount**: Full video required for temporal segmentation task
4. **Effect**: No market substitution; encourages viewing original content

### Attribution Requirements

When using this dataset, please cite:

```
@misc{blendermadeeasy2025floorplan,
  title={In-Depth Floor Plan Tutorial Part 1 [UPDATED 2025]},
  author={Blender Made Easy},
  year={2025},
  url={https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=94kAIpRnhcY},
  note={YouTube tutorial video}
}
```

### Terms of Use

- ✅ Use for AI/ML research and benchmarking
- ✅ Use for educational purposes
- ✅ Extract transcripts and metadata for analysis
- ❌ Do NOT redistribute the video file publicly
- ❌ Do NOT use for commercial purposes without creator permission
- ❌ Do NOT claim ownership of the content

## Ground Truth

The ground truth chapter information (`ground_truth.json`) was extracted from YouTube's official chapter markers provided by the video creator.

## Contact

For questions about video usage rights, contact the original creator through their YouTube channel.
